\title{Post PhD (2024 - Present)}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2025-09-03}

\p{
    Since my PhD has ended, I have been trying to unify my various interests in people, proofs, smart contracts, digital money, and zero-knowledge proofs.
    I took a job with Certora straight out of my PhD, doing a mix of formally verifying smart contracts and project managmenet/business development/product development/client support.
    Ultimately, it became clear that Certora was not the place that I was going to do my best work, so early 2025 we parted ways.
}

\p{
    I am currently doing contract work with building, designing, and verifying DeFi protocols (my specific area of expertise) while I look for something that I can truly sink my teeth into and that will define the next period of my career.
}